# ---- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The real config file. Never commit it — commit Secrets.example.xcconfig instead.
# (The anon key is a public client key, but the file is the natural place a
# service-role key would eventually get pasted by mistake, so it stays out.)
**/Secrets.xcconfig
.env
.env.local
supabase/.env

